msgctxt "3668"
msgid "So! Kiryu-san. I'm gonna guess... you're a Tokyo man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3680"
msgid "...Actually, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3692"
msgid "Knew it! ♪ My intuition's right on the money! Hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3704"
msgid "Heh. How did you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3716"
msgid ""
"Mm, people from Tokyo talk different? They got, like, this \"big city\" "
"sorta vibe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3728"
msgid "I know 'cause I was staying in Tokyo till not too long ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3740"
msgid "Boo... Now I'm getting all nostalgic... mostly for Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3752"
msgid "Kamurocho, huh? That's my neck of the woods."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3764"
msgid "Oooh, really!? I was actually doing retail over there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3776"
msgid "Is that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3788"
msgid ""
"Mhm! I would do karaoke there all the time, too! Perfect way to unwind "
"after a long day at work. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3800"
msgid ""
"Those hustler guys... whaddya call 'em... barkers? They were a little "
"creepy, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3812"
msgid "Heh. Can't argue with that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3824"
msgid "But still... I wish I could go back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3836"
msgid "How long has it been since you came back to Okinawa, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3848"
msgid "I came back in January. You know, for Coming of Age Day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3860"
msgid "Do you ever plan on going back to Tokyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3872"
msgid "Mm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3884"
msgid "...Is that a yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3896"
msgid "Well, I want to, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3908"
msgid "Did something happen while you were over there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3920"
msgid "Well, I didn't really get along with the people I worked with."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3932"
msgid "I think I did my job okay... But nobody seemed like me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3944"
msgid ""
"Eventually, I ended up quitting on the spot. Who wouldn't, after getting "
"treated the way I did? Those people were monsters."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3956"
msgid "Why would they do something like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3968"
msgid "I'm not sure..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3980"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3992"
msgid "It's not like I gave them a reason to pick on me, either."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4004"
msgid "I believe you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4016"
msgid "Sounds like you had it pretty rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4028"
msgid ""
"Mm. It was. But I kept myself busy with work, so it was kind of okay in the "
"end."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4040"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4052"
msgid "Even so! I'm not gonna let that stop me from going back to Tokyo! Someday..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4064"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I don't wanna end up having the same kinda experience, so this time "
"I'm setting myself some goals. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4076"
msgid "That's always a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4088"
msgid "Yep! Gotta stay on top of things, y'know? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4100"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4112"
msgid "I'm sure you've learned a lot from that experience, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4124"
msgid "Maybe..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4136"
msgid ""
"Maybe I just acted like I didn't have a care in the world, and that's what "
"made me stand out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4148"
msgid "Could be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4160"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I don't wanna end up in the same kinda situation, so this time I'm "
"setting myself some goals. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4172"
msgid "That's always a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4184"
msgid "Yep! Gotta stay on top of things, y'know? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4196"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4208"
msgid "Are you married, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4220"
msgid "Not at the moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4232"
msgid "Do you have any family?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4244"
msgid "...There's a girl named Haruka who's like a daughter to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4256"
msgid "Wait, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4268"
msgid "I'm confused. Is she your daughter or isn't she?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4280"
msgid "Oh! Sorry... That sounded pretty insensitive, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4292"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4304"
msgid ""
"I can only imagine how lonely she might be, though, if she doesn't have a "
"mom..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4316"
msgid "I mean, I never grew up with a daddy, so I can relate."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4328"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4340"
msgid "Oh! What's wrong, Kiryu-san!? Did I... say something bad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4352"
msgid "No... I was just thinking about Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4364"
msgid "Mm. Gotcha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4376"
msgid ""
"Don't worry. She might get lonely every now and then, but I'm sure she's "
"super happy overall! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4388"
msgid "Why do you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4400"
msgid "'Cause I can tell you really care about her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4412"
msgid ""
"Hehe, both of you are so lucky to have each other. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm honestly a little jealous. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4424"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4436"
msgid "You know what's weird, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4448"
msgid "It's my mom. All she does is drink these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4460"
msgid ""
"And I don't even know what's going on with my little brother... He hardly "
"speaks to us anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4472"
msgid "Ohhhh... Now I'm all sad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4484"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4496"
msgid "How about the rest of your family?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4508"
msgid "I have a mom and a little brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4520"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4532"
msgid "You know what's weird, though?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4544"
msgid "It's my mom. All she does is drink these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4556"
msgid ""
"And I don't even know what's going on with my brother... He hardly speaks "
"to us anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4568"
msgid "Ohhhh... Now I'm sad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4580"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4592"
msgid "Sounds like you could use some company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4604"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4616"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4628"
msgid "Nothing... It's just that you're so sweet. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4640"
msgid ""
"And you've got that deep, gentle voice... Makes me wanna listen to anything "
"you have to say."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4652"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4664"
msgid ""
"Hehe. Both you and Haruka-chan are so lucky to have each other. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm honestly a little jealous. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4676"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4688"
msgid ""
"You know what's not lucky, though? My mom. All she does is drink these "
"days..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4700"
msgid ""
"And I don't even know what's going on with my brother... He hardly speaks "
"to us anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4712"
msgid "Ohhhh... Now I'm all sad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4724"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4736"
msgid "Guess what, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4748"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4760"
msgid "You remember how I said I'd set some goals before I went back to Tokyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4772"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4784"
msgid ""
"Well, I decided to hit up a really popular fashion magazine. Sent 'em a few "
"good pics that really highlight my profile."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4796"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4808"
msgid "But... they ended up rejecting me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4820"
msgid "Darn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4832"
msgid "What were you hoping they would do with them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4844"
msgid "Oh! Right right, I totally haven't told you yet!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4856"
msgid "I wanna be a model. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> That's one of my new goals!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4868"
msgid "Nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4880"
msgid ""
"So yeah. I applied to be an amateur model, but I couldn't make it past the "
"screening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4892"
msgid "Ah. Now I understand."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4904"
msgid "Too bad you didn't make it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4916"
msgid "Yeah, I know. But it's okay. I kinda already knew it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4928"
msgid ""
"Like, there's no way I'd make it on my very first try. Gotta get those "
"first few failures outta the way, y'know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4940"
msgid "Something like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4952"
msgid ""
"So! What I'm saying is, this challenge ain't over by a longshot! And I'm "
"just getting warmed up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4964"
msgid "...Huh, I almost thought you seemed a little down about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4976"
msgid "Nope. ♪ Can't let something as small as that faze me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4988"
msgid ""
"...Though, I was kinda hoping I'd get the job anyway. Just a teeny tiny "
"bit. Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5000"
msgid "Heh. Understandable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5012"
msgid "Why don't you try somewhere else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5024"
msgid "Hm? You mean, like, other magazines?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5036"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5048"
msgid ""
"Nope! What I aim for is what I get! Besides, all my favorite models work "
"for that magazine, so there's no other option for me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5060"
msgid "Huh. All right then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5072"
msgid ""
"I doubt it'll go so smoothly... But that just means it's worth the "
"struggle, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5084"
msgid "Looks like you've already bounced back from defeat."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5096"
msgid "Of course! ♪ Can't let something as small as that faze me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5108"
msgid ""
"Although I was hoping I'd get the job right off the bat.\r\n"
"Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5120"
msgid "Heh. Understandable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5132"
msgid "You haven't given up, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5144"
msgid "Huh? No way! But you knew that already, didn't you? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5156"
msgid "Heh. I had a feeling you were just getting started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5168"
msgid "Hehe. It's like you can read my every thought. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5180"
msgid "I'm happy you know me so well. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5192"
msgid "Heh, I'm getting there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5204"
msgid "Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5216"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5228"
msgid "Have you cheated on someone before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5240"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5252"
msgid "I want your honest answer, too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5264"
msgid "I'll let that remain a secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5276"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5288"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5300"
msgid ""
"You're a big cheater, Kiryu-san! I asked you for your honest answer, and "
"now you're even cheating on my question!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5312"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5324"
msgid ""
"I know some guys just can't help it... But was it so wrong to think, \"What "
"about Kiryu-san!? I'm sure he's different!\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5336"
msgid ""
"By the way, whenever a guy doesn't say whether he's cheated or not, 90％ of "
"the time it means they have!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5348"
msgid "You... might be right on that one."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5360"
msgid "Hmph! Then you should have just said so from the start!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5372"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5384"
msgid "I think you have a very vivid imagination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5396"
msgid "Pfft, what kind of answer is that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5408"
msgid "My kind of answer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5420"
msgid ""
"Well, aren't we quirky today! Haha! I love it when a guy's not afraid to "
"act cute. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5432"
msgid "I dunno why, but something about you really tickles my funny bone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5444"
msgid ""
"Or maybe I really do have a vivid imagination. Hehehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5456"
msgid "Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5468"
msgid "Well, I am a guy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5480"
msgid "So... you have cheated before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5492"
msgid "There have been some occasions."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5504"
msgid "Ohhh... So that's the kinda guy you are..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5516"
msgid ""
"Heh, and you said it with such confidence, too. How am I supposed to react "
"to that? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5528"
msgid "However you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5540"
msgid ""
"I'm just... Wow. So even the mighty Kiryu-san needs a little comfort on the "
"side, huh? Go figure. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5552"
msgid "Well... I don't know if I'd put it quite like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5564"
msgid "Mmm... Sleepy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5576"
msgid "Don't tell me you haven't slept..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5588"
msgid ""
"Nope. After I got out of the club last night, I met up with some friends "
"and sang karaoke late into the afternoon. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5600"
msgid "That... sure is something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5612"
msgid "Mm-hmm! I'm so grateful to have her in my life. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5624"
msgid ""
"Hehe. ♪ But that means I ended up singing for like, six hours straight! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5636"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5648"
msgid "Hmph! I bet you think I overdid it, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5660"
msgid "Well, when <Italic>you're</Italic> at karaoke, how much do you sing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5672"
msgid "I can't even sing for an hour."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5684"
msgid "No way! Is that it!? Tell me you're joking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5696"
msgid "It's the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5708"
msgid "I can't believe it... That's barely any time at all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5720"
msgid ""
"How am I supposed to have fun at karaoke with you when you can barely keep "
"up with me? You're such a party pooper!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5732"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5744"
msgid "Maybe two hours?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5756"
msgid "Yeah, that sounds about right! Figured that'd be about your limit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5768"
msgid ""
"I dunno what I would've done if you'd said you could go the whole six hours "
"like I do!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5780"
msgid "Heh, same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5792"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Lemme guess, Kiryu-san, you like to sing... enka!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5804"
msgid "Yeah, I'll sing enka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5816"
msgid ""
"I knew it! You totally seemed like the kinda guy who'd sing enka! Best "
"thing is, I like enka, too. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5828"
msgid "No kidding..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5840"
msgid "I could go for six hours like it's nothing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5852"
msgid "What!? That long!? Wait, are you just tryin' to impress me or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5864"
msgid "No, not at all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5876"
msgid ""
"You sure? Sheesh, Kiryu-san, you don't have to pretend to be someone else "
"just to impress me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5888"
msgid "I wasn't?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5900"
msgid "I'm disappointed in you, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5912"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5924"
msgid "Ugh, so hungry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5936"
msgid "Have you not had dinner yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5948"
msgid ""
"I haven't had anything to eat today... It was so busy around here, I "
"totally forgot to eat something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5960"
msgid ""
"Ugh... I hope I can get off soon. I'm in the mood for a nice, hot plate of "
"rafute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5972"
msgid "Rafute? What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5984"
msgid "Huh? Wait, you've never heard of rafute before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5996"
msgid "It's only the most delicious stewed pork you'll ever eat!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6008"
msgid "Stewed pork? That does sound good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6020"
msgid ""
"You take a whole pork belly with the skin still on it, then stew it in a "
"sweet and salty sauce until it's practically falling apart. It's so good, I "
"just can't get enough of it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6032"
msgid "Sounds delicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6044"
msgid "Doesn't it? ♪ I bet you'd really like it, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6056"
msgid ""
"Oh, hey! We should go get rafute together sometime! I know the perfect "
"place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6068"
msgid "Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6080"
msgid ""
"Really!? Yay! Then we've got ourselves a deal! Don't back out on it now, "
"okay? <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6092"
msgid "You got it, heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6104"
msgid "It must really fill you with energy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6116"
msgid "Hmmm. I dunno about that, to be honest, but I do know one thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6128"
msgid "Everyone in Okinawa just loooooves to eat rafute!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6140"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6152"
msgid "Oh! But Okinawans also like to drink awamori all night!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6164"
msgid "That's gotta take a lot of energy, staying up till sunrise and drinking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6176"
msgid ""
"Maybe eating rafute gives 'em the energy to party hard all night! Hehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6188"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6200"
msgid "Now I'm hungry, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6212"
msgid "Huh? What, did you forget to eat today too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6224"
msgid "No, I just meant that the rafute sounded delicious."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6236"
msgid ""
"Really!? Well, then, do you wanna go out to eat with me right now? We "
"totally could!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6248"
msgid "Sure, sounds nice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6260"
msgid ""
"We could, buuut my boss will totally yell at me if I left in the middle of "
"my shift. Sorry! Hehe. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6272"
msgid "Heh, darn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6284"
msgid "Man... I hope I can get off work soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6296"
msgid "Heh, are you that hungry?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6308"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Man, I just looove drinking, don't you? ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6320"
msgid "That I do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6332"
msgid ""
"Y'know, the other day, I figured out why it is that I love drinking so "
"much! Wanna know why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6344"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6356"
msgid ""
"Ehe! It's 'cause drinking is super fun, and always makes me smile! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6368"
msgid ""
"Well, not when you're drinking by yourself, but when you're havin' fun with "
"a whole bunch of friends! Drinks taste so much better when you're "
"surrounded by a crowd of people!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6380"
msgid "I like drinking with lots of friends, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6392"
msgid ""
"Oh, good! ♪ I mean, I also have a lotta fun drinking when it's just the two "
"of us, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6404"
msgid "Heh. I'm glad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6416"
msgid ""
"But y'know, I could imagine you having a good time drinkin' on your own, "
"too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6428"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6440"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh! I bet you'd look all mysterious and brooding... My heart might just "
"skip a beat if I saw you like that! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6452"
msgid "Heh. I never thought about it like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6464"
msgid "I like drinking quietly by myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6476"
msgid ""
"Y'know, I can definitely see that. In fact, I've got this great image of "
"you sitting alone at a bar, lost in your own thoughts as you sip on fancy "
"whiskey..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6488"
msgid "Heh, is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6500"
msgid "Wait..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6512"
msgid ""
"If you like to drink alone, then why would you go through the trouble of "
"coming to a hostess club?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6524"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6536"
msgid "You just wanna drink with a cute girl, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6548"
msgid "You could say that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6560"
msgid "Oh. All right. I see how it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6572"
msgid ""
"You don't care about conversation, you just want a nice piece of candy on "
"your arm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6584"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6596"
msgid "I like drinking with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6608"
msgid "Yay! ♪ Kiryu-san's actually flirting with me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6620"
msgid "Hey, now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6632"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ I reaaally like you, Kiryu-san! You know that, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6644"
msgid "I... I guess I do now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6656"
msgid ""
"I mean, I'm always happier after hanging out with you. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6668"
msgid "Heh, glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6680"
msgid ""
"So the other day, I got a call from one of my friends in Kagoshima! Imagine "
"my surprise when she said she's getting married next month, and wants me to "
"come to the wedding!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6692"
msgid "That sure is out of the blue..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6704"
msgid "For real! I had to pinch myself to make sure I wasn't dreaming!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6716"
msgid ""
"She said that a bunch of our old friends are all coming, too. It's gonna be "
"like a mini high school reunion!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6728"
msgid "So anyway, I get to go to Kagoshima next month!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6740"
msgid "Have you ever been to Kagoshima?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6752"
msgid "Yup!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6764"
msgid "Oh, so you have..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6776"
msgid "Mhm! And while I do love Kagoshima, there's no place like Tokyo for me! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6788"
msgid ""
"Especially when you're there, Kiryu-san. That just makes it even better. "
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6800"
msgid "...I'm flattered."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6812"
msgid "A wedding... Sounds fun."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6824"
msgid ""
"I bet it will be! You know what's crazy though? She's only twenty, just "
"like me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6836"
msgid "Oh wow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6848"
msgid "Man, I wish I could get married soon, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6860"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6872"
msgid "Kagoshima's a nice place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6884"
msgid "It sure is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6896"
msgid "The shochu there's especially good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6908"
msgid "Oooh, you like shochu, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6920"
msgid "You should try Okinawan awamori! It's super good. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6932"
msgid "Heh... Maybe I will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6944"
msgid "Kiryu-san, do you ever go drinking at regular bars, not just hostess clubs?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6956"
msgid "All the time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6968"
msgid ""
"Cool! But y'know, I can't really imagine any places around here that you "
"might like to drink at. They just don't seem right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6980"
msgid "...Probably not, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6992"
msgid "I wish my mom's bar was closer. Then, I could take you there every day! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7004"
msgid "Your mom owns a bar?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7016"
msgid "Yup! Just on the outskirts of the city."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7028"
msgid "Really..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7040"
msgid "Yuh-huh! And a whole bunch of customers come just to see my mom!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7052"
msgid "Thanks to her, business is always booming! Hehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7064"
msgid "Heh, is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7076"
msgid ""
"When I was little, I used to help out around the bar. At least, as much as "
"I could."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7088"
msgid "She let me clear dishes and clean here and there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7100"
msgid "Sounds like you're pretty helpful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7112"
msgid ""
"You know what the best part was? When I did a good job, she let me have "
"some candy! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7124"
msgid "That sounds pretty immature, huh? Getting that excited over a candy bar..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7136"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7148"
msgid ""
"It was good in a way, too! Because I was so excited, I ended up helping my "
"mom all the time!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7160"
msgid "I'd like to go there sometime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7172"
msgid ""
"Really? You should! I bet my mom would be real\r\n"
"excited to meet you. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7184"
msgid "Huh? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7196"
msgid ""
"I think you'd definitely be her type. She'd totally be into you. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7208"
msgid "Okay, then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7220"
msgid "You don't help out there anymore?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7232"
msgid "No, I don't..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7244"
msgid ""
"Mom gets a lot of customers who are real mean when they get drunk, so she "
"said I don't have to come in and help out anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7256"
msgid "That's too bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7268"
msgid "One time, I walked by a drunk guy, and he grabbed my butt..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7280"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7292"
msgid ""
"My mom got sooo mad at him! I thought she was gonna kill him. I didn't take "
"it too personally, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7304"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7316"
msgid "Sounds like a great experience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7328"
msgid "Y'know, it really was! ♪ I had a lotta fun helping out, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7340"
msgid ""
"And even though some of the drunks were kinda mean, most of them were super "
"nice to me. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7352"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7364"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Sometimes, when my mom wasn't looking, they'd hand me\r\n"
"a few bills and tell me to \"buy myself something nice.\"\r\n"
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7376"
msgid "Sounds like they really liked you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7388"
msgid "Y'know lately, my brother's been acting kinda weird."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7400"
msgid "I didn't know you had a brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7412"
msgid "Huh? Wait, did I not tell you about him before?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7424"
msgid ""
"Well, I've got a little brother! His name's Akira, and he just started high "
"school. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7436"
msgid "Okay. How's he been acting strange, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7448"
msgid "Well, he's been skipping school a whole lot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7460"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7472"
msgid ""
"Like, I keep running into him around town when I know he's supposed to be "
"in class!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7484"
msgid ""
"I ask him about it, too. I say, \"Hey, don't you have class right now?\" "
"But he just gets mad at me and tells me to shut up..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7496"
msgid "Now I'm worried that Akira's getting caught up in some funny business..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7508"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7520"
msgid "And Mom's no help. She keeps telling me to leave him alone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7532"
msgid "If my dad was alive right now, I bet he'd give him a good talking to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7544"
msgid "\"That's enough, Akira!\" Or something real strict like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7556"
msgid "Just let him be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7568"
msgid "Whaa? Really? I should just leave him alone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7580"
msgid ""
"Yeah. It's part of being young. Sometimes, you just want to go off on your "
"own, let loose a bit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7592"
msgid "To do what, though? And what if he gets involved with something shady?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7604"
msgid "Heh, it's all right. You don't need to worry about him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7616"
msgid ""
"But why, Kiryu-san? You're not making any sense! You're just going round "
"and round in circles!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7628"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7640"
msgid "You never skipped school?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7652"
msgid "Huh? You're asking me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7664"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7676"
msgid "...Yeah. I skipped class pretty often, not gonna lie..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7688"
msgid "Well, maybe your brother's doing the same thing you did back then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7700"
msgid " So... I don't need to be all that worried about him, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7712"
msgid "Yeah. It'll be all right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7724"
msgid "Huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7736"
msgid ""
"Y'know, you're right! It's okay if he skips school sometimes, as long as he "
"ends up graduating!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7748"
msgid "Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Thanks, Kiryu-san. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7760"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7772"
msgid "I'd be worried, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7784"
msgid "...Mm-hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7796"
msgid "What if Akira gets involved in something shady? Shouldn't I do something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7808"
msgid ""
"So I went to see my mom the other day, and boy, was she in a super good "
"mood!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7820"
msgid "Apparently, one of her favorite regulars asked her out the other day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7832"
msgid "Oh? How'd that go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7844"
msgid ""
" Pretty well for him, I think! She was so flustered and giddy talking about "
"it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7856"
msgid ""
"I bet it's only a matter of time before the two of them get all lovey-dovey "
"with one another!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7868"
msgid ""
"She already bought an expensive brand-name wallet to give him as a token of "
"her affection."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7880"
msgid "I'm like, \"Come on, Mom, you're going a little overboard, don't you think?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7892"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7904"
msgid ""
"As much as I wanna be happy for her, I can't help but cringe when I see her "
"like this..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7916"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7928"
msgid ""
"She's got a bad track record when it comes to guys. It doesn't take much "
"sweet talk to scam her out of her money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7940"
msgid "I dunno what this new guy is like, but still..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7952"
msgid "I can't help but worry about her. What if this is just another scam?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7964"
msgid ""
"Plus, every time she does get scammed, she gets real depressed about it and "
"ends up crying a lot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7976"
msgid "That doesn't sound good..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "7988"
msgid "My mom's just the lonely type. She just wants to be with someone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8000"
msgid "I get why you're concerned."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8012"
msgid "...Mm-hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8024"
msgid ""
"My mom's worked herself to the bone making sure my brother and I grew up "
"right, and she did it all by herself, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8036"
msgid "I just want my mom to be happy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8048"
msgid "You're a great daughter, you know that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8060"
msgid "Well, I just wanna see my mom smile. I hate seeing her down in the dumps..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8072"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8084"
msgid "No need to worry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8096"
msgid "You think so? Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8108"
msgid "She's got a strong, independent daughter. That must've come from somewhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8120"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ Are you talking about meeee?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8132"
msgid "Who else would I be talking about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8144"
msgid "You reeeeaaally think I'm all strong and independent?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8156"
msgid "I do, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8168"
msgid "Hopefully he's a good guy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8180"
msgid "...Mm-hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8192"
msgid "If he were a decent guy, would you be all right with it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8204"
msgid "Well, of course I would be, silly! ♪ I love seeing my mom smile, after all!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8216"
msgid ""
"As long as he makes my mom happy, I'll be behind them, every step of the "
"way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8228"
msgid "I bet your mom's already pretty happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8240"
msgid "Huh? Wait, why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8252"
msgid "She's got a wonderful daughter to support her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8264"
msgid "Waaaait, are you talking about me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8276"
msgid "Who else?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8288"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Aww, you really think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8300"
msgid "Heh, I definitely do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8312"
msgid "Y'know, I never got the chance to meet my dad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8324"
msgid "It leaves me wondering what kinda person he was."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8336"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8348"
msgid "Sometimes, when something really good or kinda bad happens to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8360"
msgid ""
"...I like to think about my dad and imagine the kinda situations we'd get "
"into!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8372"
msgid "Really? Huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8384"
msgid "Yuh-huh! In my mind, my dad's really nice, but kinda shy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8396"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8408"
msgid ""
"Yup! And once a week, he goes out and buys me a toooon of rafute, just for "
"me! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8420"
msgid "Ooh, and he gets super proud of me whenever I ace a test!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8432"
msgid ""
"But if I try to mess with him when he's taking a nap, he gets kinda mad at "
"me. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8444"
msgid ""
"He also gets mad at me when I walk around the house with just a towel on. "
"He hides his face with his newspaper and says, \"Girls shouldn't strut "
"around half-naked like that!\" ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8456"
msgid "You shouldn't walk around in just a towel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8468"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8480"
msgid "Maybe that's just how my dad would say that to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8492"
msgid "...Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8504"
msgid "For a second, I thought you were really my dad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8516"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8528"
msgid ""
"But you proooobably don't wanna be my dad, do you, Kiryu-san? Hehehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8540"
msgid "I'll pass, heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8552"
msgid "You've got a great imagination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8564"
msgid "Huh? Why do you say that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8576"
msgid ""
"Well, you might not have ever met him, but you sure seem to have a real "
"good image of him in your head."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8588"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8600"
msgid "...What's wrong with imagining stuff about my dad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8612"
msgid "I just wanted to talk about it with you, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8624"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8636"
msgid "Sounds like a fun family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8648"
msgid "Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Doesn't he sound fun?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8660"
msgid "Yeah, for sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8672"
msgid "Y'know, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8684"
msgid "It's all in my imagination. I know it's never gonna happen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8696"
msgid "...'Cause my dad's not around anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8708"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8720"
msgid "Kiryu-san, big news! I finally heard back from them!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8732"
msgid "Heard back from who?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8744"
msgid "That fashion magazine I applied to! You know, for modeling?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8756"
msgid "Oh, right. What'd they say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8768"
msgid "Hehe. Another no..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8780"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8792"
msgid "I sent in a pretty sexy picture, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8804"
msgid "Sexy...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8816"
msgid "Mm-hmm. I was barely wearing anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8828"
msgid "But I'm not giving up! Not now, not ever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8840"
msgid "Good to hear it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8852"
msgid ""
"One of these days, I'm gonna be a model! I'm gonna keep trying until I get "
"there, no matter how many tries it takes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8864"
msgid "I'll keep fighting this battle till I finally win! Yeah!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8876"
msgid "I'm rooting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8888"
msgid "Hehe! Thanks a bunch! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8900"
msgid "Want me to help take pictures of you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8912"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! Oh, sure, you wanna help. I bet you're just in it to get some sexy "
"pictures of me, riiiight?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8924"
msgid ""
"That's not what I was getting at. But now that you bring it up... I "
"wouldn't mind at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8936"
msgid ""
"Weeell, if that's the case, maaaaaybe I'll ask you to help out next time. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8948"
msgid "...You got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8960"
msgid "Wish I could see that picture you sent in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8972"
msgid "Whaaaaat!? You wanna see my sexy picture!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8984"
msgid ""
"I dunno, it might be too much of a risk showing you... I barely had "
"anything on, after all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "8996"
msgid "Barely... anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9008"
msgid ""
"Yeah! I'd be soooo embarrassed if you saw it, Kiryu-san... I don't think I "
"could live it down!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9020"
msgid "It was that good, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9032"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9044"
msgid "Kiryu-san, just what're you imagining over there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9056"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9068"
msgid "I was barely wearing any makeup. Not clothes, silly!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9080"
msgid "You were totally undressing me in your mind right now, weren't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9092"
msgid "...Heh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9104"
msgid "What if you get rejected again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9116"
msgid "...Why are you asking that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9128"
msgid "Well, can't you try to apply for other magazines, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9140"
msgid "I told you, I wanna be in this one!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9152"
msgid "I can't give up on something before I've even tried, now can I?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9164"
msgid "At least, that's what my favorite teacher taught me when I was a kid!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9176"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9188"
msgid "So earlier, I went to see a movie. It was sooo good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9200"
msgid "I went to see, uh... shoot..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9212"
msgid "I forgot what it was called, but it was about a firefighter. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9224"
msgid "Heh. Okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9236"
msgid "But man, the main character guy was soooo cool!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9248"
msgid ""
"He was in all these crazy situations, but no matter what happened, he had "
"to stay focused, give it his all, and put out those fires and rescue those "
"people!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9260"
msgid "I was totally swooning over him! I think he's my type."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9272"
msgid "Heh, so you're into firefighters?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9284"
msgid "As long as he's someone I can depend on, no matter what, then yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9296"
msgid ""
"He's gotta be someone who doesn't complain, someone who always takes the "
"lead..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9308"
msgid ""
"And he'd never back down, no matter who or what he's up against! That's my "
"ideal type of guy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9320"
msgid "Those aren't bad values to have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9332"
msgid ""
"But you know, sometimes that backfires on me. Like, I'll go out with a guy "
"I think is perfect..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9344"
msgid "But they turn out to be totally different than I thought..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9356"
msgid ""
"I guess there aren't a lot of guys out there that meet my expectations, "
"huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9368"
msgid "What do you think I'm like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9380"
msgid "Huh? You're asking me to judge you, based off what I know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9392"
msgid "Yeah. What do you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9404"
msgid "Ummm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9416"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9428"
msgid ""
"...You're probably real dependable, but in more of a fatherly way than "
"anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9440"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9452"
msgid "That's how it works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9464"
msgid "You really think so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9476"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9488"
msgid ""
"Ideal partners are just that. It's extremely rare that someone actually "
"finds them in real life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9500"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9512"
msgid "Y'know, you've got a pretty dark view of the world, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9524"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9536"
msgid "Focus on bettering yourself first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9548"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9560"
msgid "Work hard to become a better woman, and a better man will find you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9572"
msgid "Become a better woman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9584"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9596"
msgid "Huh! That makes a lotta sense! That's gotta be it! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9608"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9620"
msgid "From now on, I'm gonna work on myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9632"
msgid "That's the spirit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9644"
msgid "Y'know, Kiryu-san, whenever I'm hanging out with you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9656"
msgid "...Yes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9668"
msgid "I always end up remembering things about the guy I dated back in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9680"
msgid "It's weird 'cause the two of you aren't even alike."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9692"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9704"
msgid "Hehehe. ♪ You curious?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9716"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9728"
msgid "A-ha! You <Italic>are</Italic> curious! I suppose I gotta tell you, then!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9740"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9752"
msgid ""
"So it was back when I was working at that shop. One day, I got reeeaaally "
"sick, like, couldn't even get out of bed sick."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9764"
msgid ""
"I had this crazy high fever, and I couldn't stop coughing. I seriously "
"thought I was a goner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9776"
msgid "But I lived to tell the tale... 'cause he nursed me back to life."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9788"
msgid "He came by my place every day till I got better!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9800"
msgid "Really? That was nice of him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9812"
msgid ""
"Wasn't it? When it was all going down, I thought to myself, this is the "
"first time since I moved to Tokyo that a guy has been this nice to me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9824"
msgid "Before I knew it, I was head over heels! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9836"
msgid ""
"...But after we'd been dating for a while, I found out he was married with "
"a wife and kids."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9848"
msgid "...Whoa. Seriously?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9860"
msgid "Mm-hmm. In the end, I wasn't his girlfriend, I was just his side piece."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9872"
msgid ""
"So after I found that out, things went downhill, and I ended up breaking up "
"with him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9884"
msgid "It's not that big of a deal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9896"
msgid "Huh? Wait, are you saying you think it's okay to have a side piece?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9908"
msgid "I mean, I wouldn't do that, but sure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9920"
msgid "Wait, what? Are you for real right now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9932"
msgid ""
"You're acting like this isn't even a real problem! Well, it is, and it "
"happened to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9944"
msgid "You're a big meanie, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9956"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9968"
msgid "You made the right choice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9980"
msgid "...Mm-hmm, I think so, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "9992"
msgid "I can't imagine what his family must've gone through because of me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10004"
msgid "But I don't wanna lie and say that I regret it. I'm glad I met him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10016"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10028"
msgid "You know, I'm single."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10040"
msgid "Oh? Hehehe. ♪ Are you trying to get me to ask you out, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10052"
msgid "...Maybe?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10064"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! Y'know, if I asked you out, I wouldn't be your side piece, I'd be "
"your real piece, huh! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10076"
msgid "But d'ya think I could be a good mom to Haruka-chan? Hmm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10088"
msgid "Wait, hold on a moment there..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10100"
msgid "Hehehe... <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10112"
msgid "...What's so funny?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10124"
msgid "Oh, nothing. I was just thinking about the first time I met you, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10148"
msgid "At first, I was kinda worried you were gonna be this big, mean guy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10160"
msgid "But you totally weren't! Yay! Hehe! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10172"
msgid "...Well, that's good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10184"
msgid "Sometimes, I wish you were my dad, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10196"
msgid "You want me to be... your dad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10208"
msgid "Mm-hmm. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10220"
msgid "...Oh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10232"
msgid "Huh? Why the long face? Did I say something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10244"
msgid ""
"Well... It's hard to find the right reaction when you're saying that right "
"to my face..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10256"
msgid ""
"Ahaha! Oh my gosh, Kiryu-san, are you blushing? You're soooo cute! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10268"
msgid "You're the cutest daddy a girl could ask for! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10280"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10292"
msgid "I have my hands full with Haruka."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10304"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10316"
msgid "Wait, I think you're getting the wrong idea here, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10328"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10340"
msgid "See, what I was tryyying to say..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10352"
msgid "...Was that I trust you like I'd trust my own dad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10364"
msgid "And, well, that's 'cause..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10376"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10388"
msgid "Because?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10400"
msgid "...Never mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10412"
msgid "...After all that buildup, you're not gonna tell me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10424"
msgid "Sure, I'll be your daddy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10436"
msgid "Wait, whaaaat!? Are you being serious with me right now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10448"
msgid "Heh, sure am. I'll be your daddy whenever I come to visit you here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10460"
msgid "Oh... So that's what you mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10472"
msgid "...Is that a no?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10484"
msgid "Well, I do get pretty lonely without you here to keep me company..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10496"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10508"
msgid "So remember how I used to work at a shop in Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10520"
msgid "Yeah, what about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10532"
msgid "Well, one of my friends who worked there with me just called me yesterday!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10544"
msgid "I hadn't heard from her in forever, so I was super happy to hear her voice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10556"
msgid "That's a nice surprise."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10568"
msgid ""
"She's such an awesome person! I really owe her for all the help she gave me "
"back then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10580"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10592"
msgid "Mm-hmm. I'd be nowhere without her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10604"
msgid ""
"Remember how I said I had trouble interacting with customers back at the "
"shop?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10616"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10628"
msgid "She was the only coworker who was nice to me, despite all my screwups!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10640"
msgid "She gave me tons of advice, and helped me get out of sticky situations..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10652"
msgid "I'm so lucky to have had her! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10664"
msgid "Sounds like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10676"
msgid ""
"We've been friends ever since! It's tough, but we still try to keep in "
"touch. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10688"
msgid "How bad was it back then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10700"
msgid ""
"Pretty bad. To tell the truth, I was thiiiiis close to calling it quits and "
"moving back to Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10712"
msgid "But because she was there for me, I was able to keep at it! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10724"
msgid "Good to hear."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10736"
msgid "Mm-hmm! ♪ She's the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10748"
msgid "Ooh, and get this!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10760"
msgid ""
"We've got this bet going to see what happens first: me becoming a model in "
"Tokyo, or her coming to Okinawa to visit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10772"
msgid "The race is on! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10784"
msgid "Heh, good luck."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10796"
msgid "Sounds like a great friend."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10808"
msgid "Mm-hmm! I'm so grateful to have her in my life. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10820"
msgid ""
"She told me she's gonna come see me soon! I can't wait to show her how well "
"I'm doing out here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10832"
msgid "Sounds like a plan."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10844"
msgid ""
"Ooh! And maybe she can meet you, too! ♪ I'll tell her you're my new "
"boyfriend! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10856"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10868"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! ♪ You're sooooo cute when you get flustered like that, Kiryu-san! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10880"
msgid "Hardly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10892"
msgid "What's she like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10904"
msgid "Let's see... She's more pretty than cute."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10916"
msgid "Like, the total opposite of me! She's super chill, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10928"
msgid "Is that right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10940"
msgid "Huh! Oh, nooooo! You're thinking about her right now, aren't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10952"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10964"
msgid ""
"Stoppp! Don't think about other girls, not when you're sitting right next "
"to me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10976"
msgid "...Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "10988"
msgid "So today, I ran into one of my elementary school teachers!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11000"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11012"
msgid ""
"Yeah! It was so great to see him! ♪ I hadn't seen him at all since I went "
"to middle school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11024"
msgid "But anyway! My teacher told me he started a sanshin club!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11036"
msgid "Sanshin? What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11048"
msgid ""
"Oh, you've never heard of a sanshin? It's an instrument that's kinda like "
"the shamisen. I think it might've been the instrument that the shamisen's "
"based on or something..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11060"
msgid "...Huh. That's rad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11072"
msgid "Y'know, I'm reaaally good at the sanshin. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11084"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11096"
msgid ""
"Yup! And my teacher remembered that, too, so he invited me to join his "
"club! ♪ I'm so excited!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11108"
msgid "I can't believe he remembered you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11120"
msgid "I know! I was totally shocked when he did!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11132"
msgid ""
"I even asked him how he remembered me after all this time, and you know "
"what he said?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11144"
msgid ""
"He said he remembered me 'cause I was so good at the sanshin! Apparently "
"that really stuck with him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11156"
msgid "Oh, wow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11168"
msgid "I know! It was so sweet of him, I started to tear up! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11180"
msgid "Heh... That's sweet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11192"
msgid "Do you still play?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11204"
msgid "Mm-hmm! Every now and then I'll pull it out and play for a while. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11216"
msgid ""
"I wouldn't mind playing a few songs for you, Kiryu-san! It's been a while, "
"but I'm still pretty good! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11228"
msgid "Really? Looking forward to it, then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11240"
msgid "Oh, shoot! I just remembered, one of my strings broke the other day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11252"
msgid "I totally forgot to put on a new one..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11264"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11276"
msgid "I'd love to hear you play."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11288"
msgid ""
"Hehehe! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> You wanna hear me tear it up on the "
"sanshin?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11300"
msgid "Yeah, I bet it'll sound beautiful."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11312"
msgid ""
"I dunno, though, it might be hard... I mean, I'll probably get all shy and "
"flustered playing for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11324"
msgid "So you won't play for me, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11336"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11348"
msgid "I'll think about it, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11360"
msgid "Heh, just let me know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11372"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, I'm kinda worried about something. Could you hear me out for a "
"sec?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11384"
msgid "Sure, what's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11396"
msgid ""
"Y'see, at the town's big coming-of-age ceremony, I got interviewed by the "
"local TV station."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11408"
msgid "Oh, cool."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11420"
msgid ""
"So they asked me, \"How are you feeling today, on the day of your "
"coming-of-age ceremony?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11432"
msgid "I opened my mouth to say something, but I just couldn't..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11444"
msgid "...Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11456"
msgid "You know how I never met my dad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11468"
msgid ""
"I was wanting to say something like, \"I wanna thank my parents for "
"bringing me into the world and taking care of me...\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11480"
msgid ""
"But then I felt awkward all of a sudden, and I ended up just saying "
"nothing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11492"
msgid "No need to say it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11504"
msgid "Huh? Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11516"
msgid ""
"You don't need to go spouting off about it on camera. As long as you feel "
"thankful in your heart, that's enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11528"
msgid "Mm... I guess you're right about that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11540"
msgid "Still, I can't help but feel jealous of everyone else sometimes..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11552"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11564"
msgid "You should say it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11576"
msgid "Huh!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11588"
msgid ""
"Come right out and say it. Tell them you never knew your dad, but you're "
"thankful for him, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11600"
msgid "Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11612"
msgid ""
"Y'know what, you're right. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I mean, that is how I "
"feel about it, after all. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11624"
msgid "Right, and isn't that the most important thing? Food for thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11636"
msgid "Don't drag it with you forever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11648"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11660"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11672"
msgid "You should feel happy just to have a family that supports you, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11684"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11696"
msgid "I mean, I do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11708"
msgid "Then why worry about it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11720"
msgid "It's not like I was worried about it! I was just feeling kinda lonely..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11732"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11744"
msgid ""
"Y'know, I was thinking, maybe it's harder to be a teen guy than it is to be "
"a teen girl..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11756"
msgid "...Is this about your brother?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11768"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11780"
msgid "When we were little, we were practically inseparable!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11792"
msgid ""
"He'd chase me around he house, shouting, \"Saya! Come play with me!\" I "
"couldn't get away from him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11804"
msgid ""
"But now, whenever I call him he doesn't pick up, and he never texts me "
"back, either. Sometimes, he doesn't even come home at night..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11816"
msgid "You worried about him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11828"
msgid "Yeah, super worried..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11840"
msgid "My mom's been working the bar ever since we were kids..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11852"
msgid "So I've basically always taken care of my brother."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11864"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11876"
msgid "Your brother's not a kid anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11888"
msgid "Yeah, I know, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11900"
msgid "Maybe you just need to let go of him already. Okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11912"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11924"
msgid "*sniffle*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11936"
msgid "You didn't have to go that far, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11948"
msgid "I'm just worried about my little brother, that's all..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11960"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11972"
msgid "You're so motherly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11984"
msgid "....Huh, I guess I kinda am."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "11996"
msgid "Waaaaait, but I don't wanna be a mom! I'm still just a kid!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12008"
msgid "It'd be kinda weird if I was both."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12020"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12032"
msgid "He's just at that rebellious age."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12044"
msgid "I guess... Then, does that mean I won't have to worry about him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12056"
msgid "What do you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12068"
msgid ""
"Hmm... Well, if it's just a phase he's going through, then he should grow "
"out of it eventually, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12080"
msgid "Yeah, that's probably what it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12092"
msgid ""
"Hehe! ♪ Then I won't worry! Besides, I feel like you know these things, "
"Kiryu-san. If you say it'll get better, then I believe you! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12104"
msgid "That's the spirit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12116"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12128"
msgid "Hmm? What's up?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12140"
msgid "...Are you going back to Tokyo again?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12152"
msgid "Yeah, pretty soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12164"
msgid "Oh, okay. Guess things are gonna get pretty lonely around here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12176"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12188"
msgid "But y'know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12200"
msgid "I'm gonna go to Tokyo, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12212"
msgid "Ah, that's right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12224"
msgid ""
"Okay! No more moping! I'm gonna save up a ton of money and get myself to "
"Tokyo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12236"
msgid "Then, we'll hang out again in Tokyo! Yay! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12248"
msgid "I'll be waiting for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12260"
msgid "Really!? So it's totally okay for me to come see you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12272"
msgid "What, you weren't going to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12284"
msgid ""
"Of course I'm gonna! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I can't wait to hang out "
"with you over there!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12296"
msgid "Heh, same."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12308"
msgid "When can you leave?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12320"
msgid "Hehehe... ♪ Why do you ask? Are you excited for me to come out to visit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12332"
msgid "Maybe a little."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12344"
msgid ""
"Okey-dokey! Then I'm definitely gonna fly out to Tokyo to\r\n"
"see you! ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12356"
msgid "...I'd like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12368"
msgid "You don't have to force yourself to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12380"
msgid "Huh? Wait, do you not want me to visit, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12392"
msgid "No, that's not what I mean..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12404"
msgid "...So, then, you do want me to visit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12416"
msgid "Well, maybe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12428"
msgid ""
"Huh? I don't get it! Which is it? Y'know, I don't really like guys who are "
"super wishy-washy..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12440"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12452"
msgid "Oh man, my place is a total garbage fire!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12464"
msgid "Wait, what? It's on fire!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12476"
msgid ""
"Well, not on fire, but full of garbage! I haven't cleaned it in a super "
"long time. It's gotten so bad, I can't even see the floor anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12488"
msgid "Oh... really?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12500"
msgid ""
"Mm-hmm. There's dirty laundry piled up everywhere, and the trash can is "
"overflowing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12512"
msgid "There's this weird smell in the living room, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12524"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12536"
msgid "It got me thinking that I should prooobably clean up a bit..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12548"
msgid "Sooooo, I decided that I'll do it on my next day off!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12560"
msgid ""
"Oh man, I'm probably gonna find all sorts of weird stuff under that sea of "
"crap... Not looking forward to that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12572"
msgid "No... I refuse to believe it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12584"
msgid "Wait... Are you that shocked? Oh, geez..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12596"
msgid "...Why don't you clean up after yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12608"
msgid "Well... I've been kinda busy, and... yeah..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12620"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12632"
msgid "Uuuuugh... I'm kinda scared to clean up that mess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12644"
msgid "What if I start digging through stuff and run into something really gross?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12656"
msgid ""
"...You've got to get that mess cleaned up, no matter how terrifying it "
"might be."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12668"
msgid "Can't believe you were fine with it until now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12680"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I mean, maybe I'll be okay with this "
"mess! I just have to get used to it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12692"
msgid "No, you still need to clean it up. It's for the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12704"
msgid "Yeah, I know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12716"
msgid ""
"Y'know what would make me suuuper happy? If you helped me clean up, "
"Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12728"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12740"
msgid "You could get sick, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12752"
msgid "Huh? Y'know, I have heard that! I guess you're right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12764"
msgid ""
"Aww, man, what am I supposed to do about all those germs? Should I get some "
"disinfectant spray or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12776"
msgid ""
"Should I get a mask? I should get a mask. Where's my phone? I gotta write "
"all this down..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12788"
msgid "...Maybe you should calm down first?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12800"
msgid "So, remember my brother? You met not that long ago, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12812"
msgid "Yeah. Akira, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12824"
msgid "...Mm-hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12836"
msgid "Is something wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12848"
msgid "Well, my friend said she saw Akira the other day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12860"
msgid "He was walking around with a bunch of scary-looking guys..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12872"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12884"
msgid ""
"I asked my brother what that was all about, but he wouldn't tell me "
"anything..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12896"
msgid "That's not a good sign..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12908"
msgid "I thought, well, maybe she just saw someone who looked like him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12920"
msgid ""
"But she said she heard the guys call him by his name, so it must've been "
"him..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "12932"
msgid ""
"I can't help but wonder what he's getting up to, you know? Like, what if "
